{"id":"bd763d4226585f93f344120dff5ef2cb27730de8","url":"https://starcraft-shooter-2026.pages.dev/","title":"StarCraft: Ashfall","site_name":"Zeli","source":"Hacker News · 24h最热","byline":null,"excerpt":"A fan-made StarCraft game. Completely free, on web and mobile. Command Terran and Protoss forces, hold the bridge, and see how deep the swarm really goes.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><DIV id=\"app\">\n<div id=\"loading\"><p><img src=\"/assets/ui/starcraft-ashfall-logo.webp?v=4cf59188d7\" alt=\"StarCraft: Ashfall\"><strong data-i18n=\"loading.title\">建立战场连接...</strong></p><p><small data-i18n=\"loading.units\">正在载入作战单位</small></p></div>\n\n\n<header><a href=\"./\"><img src=\"/assets/ui/starcraft-ashfall-logo.webp?v=4cf59188d7\" alt=\"StarCraft: Ashfall\"></a><p><i></i> <b id=\"force-name\">TERRAN EXPEDITIONARY FORCE</b> <span data-i18n=\"topbar.operation\">灰烬长桥 / 01</span></p></header>\n\n<section id=\"hud\" data-i18n-attr=\"aria-label:hud.console\" aria-label=\"战斗控制台\">\n  <div>\n    <p><span data-i18n=\"hud.sector\">战区态势</span></p>\n    <div><div><canvas id=\"tactical-map\" width=\"192\" height=\"112\" data-i18n-attr=\"aria-label:hud.radar\" aria-label=\"实时部队和虫群位置\"></canvas><p><span>SECTOR 01</span></p></div><p><small data-i18n=\"hud.kills\">歼敌</small><b id=\"kill-count\">000</b><span id=\"wave-name\">01 / 突入虫群</span></p></div>\n    <div><p><span data-i18n=\"hud.mission\">任务</span></p><p><b id=\"timer\">01:00</b></p></div>\n    <div><p><span data-i18n=\"hud.line\">桥面防线</span></p><p><b id=\"line-label\">100%</b></p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <div><p><img id=\"command-portrait\" src=\"/assets/ui/marine.webp?v=b215090663\" data-i18n-attr=\"alt:unit.marine\" alt=\"机枪兵\"></p><p><span data-i18n=\"hud.linked\">通讯已接通 <i></i></span><span data-i18n=\"hud.linkedShort\">已接通</span></p></div>\n    <div><p><strong id=\"squad-name\" data-i18n=\"hud.squadTerran\">人族突击队</strong><b id=\"weapon-level\">等级 0</b></p><p><small data-i18n=\"hud.unitClass\">动力装甲 / 地面作战</small></p><p><span data-i18n=\"hud.infantry\">步兵 <b id=\"troop-count\">10</b></span><span data-i18n=\"hud.heavy\">重装 <b id=\"tank-count\">00</b></span><span data-i18n=\"hud.losses\">损失 <b id=\"loss-count\">0</b></span></p><div><p><b id=\"health-label\">100%</b></p></div><p><i></i>全队自动开火 <span data-i18n=\"hud.pickSides\"><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>D</kbd> 左右选择增援</span></p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"loadout\"><p><img src=\"/assets/ui/units/marine.webp?v=3934e87bd5\" alt=\"\"><span data-i18n=\"unit.marine\">机枪兵</span><b>10</b></p><p><img src=\"/assets/ui/units/firebat.webp?v=41f422e6ed\" alt=\"\"><span data-i18n=\"unit.firebat\">火蝠</span><b>0</b></p><p><img src=\"/assets/ui/units/tank.webp?v=1c6fd249a6\" alt=\"\"><span data-i18n=\"unit.tank\">攻城坦克</span><b>0</b></p><div><p><strong id=\"weapon-name\" data-i18n=\"hud.weaponName\">C-14 电磁步枪</strong><small id=\"weapon-description\" data-i18n=\"hud.weaponDescription\">密集点射 / 自动索敌</small><span id=\"overdrive-label\">经验 0 / 180</span></p></div></div>\n  <p><span data-i18n=\"hud.mission\">任务 <b id=\"mobile-timer\">01:00</b></span><span data-i18n=\"hud.kills\">歼敌 <b id=\"mobile-kills\">0</b></span><span data-i18n=\"hud.lineShort\">防线 <b id=\"mobile-line\">100%</b></span><span id=\"mobile-phase\">突入虫群</span></p>\n</section>\n\n<p><span id=\"decision-label\" data-i18n=\"hud.beacon\">增援信标</span><b id=\"decision-time\">1s</b><i id=\"decision-fill\"></i></p>\n<p><span data-i18n=\"hud.killRate\">歼敌速度<small data-i18n=\"hud.killRateWindow\">最近 3 秒</small></span><b id=\"combo-count\">0</b><small data-i18n=\"hud.perSecond\">/ 秒</small><i><i id=\"kill-rate-fill\"></i></i></p>\n<p><img id=\"upgrade-icon\" src=\"/assets/ui/marine.webp?v=b215090663\" alt=\"\"><span data-i18n=\"toast.reinforced\">增援已抵达</span><b id=\"upgrade-title\"></b><small id=\"upgrade-detail\"></small></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section id=\"welcome\" aria-labelledby=\"mission-title\">\n  <p><span data-i18n=\"welcome.briefing\">临时作战通知</span><span><i></i> ONLINE</span></p>\n  <div>\n    <p><span>01</span> 作战简报 <small>TERRAN / BRIEFING</small></p>\n    <h2 data-i18n=\"welcome.title\" id=\"mission-title\">灰烬长桥</h2>\n    <div>\n      <p><img src=\"/assets/ui/marine.webp?v=b215090663\" data-i18n-attr=\"alt:welcome.commsAlt\" alt=\"机枪兵通讯画面\"><span>CH. 01 <i></i></span></p>\n      <div><p>突击队通讯 <span data-i18n=\"welcome.signal\">信号稳定</span></p><p data-i18n-html=\"welcome.premise\">后勤说十个人够了.<br>虫子好像没收到通知.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div><div><p><span data-i18n=\"welcome.commander\">指挥官</span></p></div><details><summary><span data-i18n=\"welcome.mutators\">突变因子</span><small id=\"mutator-summary\"></small></summary><small data-i18n=\"welcome.mutatorsHint\">领取几次补给后生效</small></details><p><span data-i18n=\"welcome.deployKey\"><kbd>Space</kbd> 部署</span><span data-i18n=\"welcome.move\"><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>D</kbd> 左右移动</span><span data-i18n=\"welcome.drag\">拖动部队选择路线</span></p></div>\n  <p><span data-i18n=\"welcome.best\">最高歼敌记录</span><b id=\"best-score\">000</b><span><span data-i18n=\"season.bestLayer\">层数</span> <b id=\"best-layer\">0</b></span></p>\n</section>\n\n\n<p>左右移动 / 自动开火</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</DIV></DIV>","content_text":"建立战场连接...正在载入作战单位 TERRAN EXPEDITIONARY FORCE 灰烬长桥 / 01 战区态势 SECTOR 01歼敌00001 / 突入虫群 任务01:00 桥面防线100% 通讯已接通 已接通 人族突击队等级 0动力装甲 / 地面作战步兵 10重装 00损失 0100%全队自动开火 AD 左右选择增援 机枪兵10火蝠0攻城坦克0C-14 电磁步枪密集点射 / 自动索敌经验 0 / 180 任务 01:00歼敌 0防线 100%突入虫群 增援信标1s 歼敌速度最近 3 秒0/ 秒 增援已抵达 临时作战通知 ONLINE 01 作战简报 TERRAN / BRIEFING 灰烬长桥 CH. 01 突击队通讯 信号稳定后勤说十个人够了.虫子好像没收到通知. 指挥官突变因子领取几次补给后生效Space 部署AD 左右移动拖动部队选择路线 最高歼敌记录000层数 0 左右移动 / 自动开火","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T23:16:04.705Z","ok":true}